{"seq":2,"slug":"progress-and-spinners","title":"进度与动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/progress-and-spinners","wordCount":670,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"进度与动画\">进度与动画</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>进度反馈</strong>（Progress Feedback）解决的是&quot;等待的不确定性&quot;：当操作耗时超过一秒，用户需要知道程序仍在正常工作、进展到哪一步。反馈形式应与<strong>耗时是否可预估</strong>相匹配。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>耗时/已知量</th>\n<th>推荐形式</th>\n<th>传达的信息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 1 秒</td>\n<td>无需反馈</td>\n<td>直接给结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时长未知</td>\n<td>Spinner + 文本</td>\n<td>仍在运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总量已知</td>\n<td>进度条 + 百分比</td>\n<td>完成比例与 ETA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两条工程约束贯穿全文：<strong>进度输出必须走 stderr</strong>（避免污染 stdout 的管道数据），以及<strong>在非 TTY 环境自动降级</strong>（避免在日志里堆满动画转义码）。本文对比 Rust 的 indicatif 与 Node.js 的 ora。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要进度反馈\">为什么需要进度反馈</h2><p><strong>进度反馈</strong>（Progress Feedback）是 CLI 工具用户体验的关键组成部分。当一个操作耗时超过一秒，用户就需要知道程序是否在正常工作。没有任何反馈的长时间等待，会让用户怀疑程序是否已经卡死。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作耗时</th>\n<th>推荐反馈</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 1秒</td>\n<td>无需反馈</td>\n<td>直接显示结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1-5秒</td>\n<td>Spinner</td>\n<td>表示正在处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5秒以上</td>\n<td>进度条</td>\n<td>显示完成百分比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定时长</td>\n<td>Spinner + 状态文本</td>\n<td>告知当前步骤</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[开始任务] --&gt; B{耗时预估}&#10;    B --&gt;|已知总量| C[进度条]&#10;    B --&gt;|未知时长| D[Spinner]&#10;    C --&gt; E[百分比 + ETA]&#10;    D --&gt; F[动画 + 状态文本]&#10;    E --&gt; G[完成消息]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph LR\n    A[开始任务] --&gt; B{耗时预估}\n    B --&gt;|已知总量| C[进度条]\n    B --&gt;|未知时长| D[Spinner]\n    C --&gt; E[百分比 + ETA]\n    D --&gt; F[动画 + 状态文本]\n    E --&gt; G[完成消息]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"rust-indicatif\">Rust：indicatif</h2><p><strong>indicatif</strong> 是 Rust 生态中功能最强大的进度显示库，支持单进度条、多进度条和 spinner。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use indicatif::{ProgressBar, ProgressStyle, MultiProgress, ProgressFinish};&#10;use std::time::Duration;&#10;&#10;fn download_simulation() {&#10;    let pb = ProgressBar::new(100);&#10;    pb.set_style(&#10;        ProgressStyle::default_bar()&#10;            .template(&quot;{spinner:.green} [{elapsed_precise}] [{bar:40.cyan/blue}] {pos}/{len} ({eta}) {msg}&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap()&#10;            .progress_chars(&quot;█▓░&quot;),&#10;    );&#10;&#10;    for i in 0..100 {&#10;        pb.set_message(format!(&quot;下载文件 {}.dat&quot;, i));&#10;        pb.inc(1);&#10;        std::thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(50));&#10;    }&#10;    pb.finish_with_message(&quot;下载完成 ✓&quot;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn multi_task_simulation() {&#10;    let mp = MultiProgress::new();&#10;&#10;    let style = ProgressStyle::default_bar()&#10;        .template(&quot;{prefix:&gt;12.cyan.bold} [{bar:25}] {pos}/{len} {msg}&quot;)&#10;        .unwrap();&#10;&#10;    let pb1 = mp.add(ProgressBar::new(50));&#10;    pb1.set_style(style.clone());&#10;    pb1.set_prefix(&quot;编译&quot;);&#10;&#10;    let pb2 = mp.add(ProgressBar::new(30));&#10;    pb2.set_style(style.clone());&#10;    pb2.set_prefix(&quot;测试&quot;);&#10;&#10;    let pb3 = mp.add(ProgressBar::new(20));&#10;    pb3.set_style(style);&#10;    pb3.set_prefix(&quot;打包&quot;);&#10;&#10;    let handles: Vec&lt;_&gt; = vec![&#10;        (pb1, 50, 40),&#10;        (pb2, 30, 60),&#10;        (pb3, 20, 80),&#10;    ]&#10;    .into_iter()&#10;    .map(|(pb, total, delay)| {&#10;        std::thread::spawn(move || {&#10;            for _ in 0..total {&#10;                pb.inc(1);&#10;                std::thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(delay));&#10;            }&#10;            pb.finish_with_message(&quot;✓&quot;);&#10;        })&#10;    })&#10;    .collect();&#10;&#10;    for h in handles {&#10;        h.join().unwrap();&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    download_simulation();&#10;    println!();&#10;    multi_task_simulation();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use indicatif::{ProgressBar, ProgressStyle, MultiProgress, ProgressFinish};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::time::Duration;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn download_simulation() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let pb = ProgressBar::new(100);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pb.set_style(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ProgressStyle::default_bar()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .template(\"{spinner:.green} [{elapsed_precise}] [{bar:40.cyan/blue}] {pos}/{len} ({eta}) {msg}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .progress_chars(\"█▓░\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..100 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pb.set_message(format!(\"下载文件 {}.dat\", i));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pb.inc(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        std::thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(50));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pb.finish_with_message(\"下载完成 ✓\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn multi_task_simulation() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mp = MultiProgress::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let style = ProgressStyle::default_bar()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .template(\"{prefix:>12.cyan.bold} [{bar:25}] {pos}/{len} {msg}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let pb1 = mp.add(ProgressBar::new(50));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pb1.set_style(style.clone());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pb1.set_prefix(\"编译\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let pb2 = mp.add(ProgressBar::new(30));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pb2.set_style(style.clone());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pb2.set_prefix(\"测试\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let pb3 = mp.add(ProgressBar::new(20));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pb3.set_style(style);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pb3.set_prefix(\"打包\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let handles: Vec&#x3C;_> = vec![</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (pb1, 50, 40),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (pb2, 30, 60),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (pb3, 20, 80),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .into_iter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .map(|(pb, total, delay)| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        std::thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            for _ in 0..total {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                pb.inc(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                std::thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(delay));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            pb.finish_with_message(\"✓\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for h in handles {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        h.join().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    download_simulation();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    multi_task_simulation();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"spinner-动画\">Spinner 动画</h2><p><strong>Spinner</strong>（旋转动画）用于不确定时长的操作，告诉用户程序仍在运行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use indicatif::{ProgressBar, ProgressStyle};&#10;use std::time::Duration;&#10;&#10;fn spinner_demo() {&#10;    let spinner = ProgressBar::new_spinner();&#10;    spinner.set_style(&#10;        ProgressStyle::default_spinner()&#10;            .tick_strings(&amp;[&quot;⠋&quot;, &quot;⠙&quot;, &quot;⠹&quot;, &quot;⠸&quot;, &quot;⠼&quot;, &quot;⠴&quot;, &quot;⠦&quot;, &quot;⠧&quot;, &quot;⠇&quot;, &quot;⠏&quot;])&#10;            .template(&quot;{spinner:.green} {msg}&quot;)&#10;            .unwrap(),&#10;    );&#10;&#10;    let steps = vec![&#10;        &quot;正在解析依赖...&quot;,&#10;        &quot;正在下载包...&quot;,&#10;        &quot;正在编译项目...&quot;,&#10;        &quot;正在运行测试...&quot;,&#10;    ];&#10;&#10;    for step in steps {&#10;        spinner.set_message(step.to_string());&#10;        for _ in 0..20 {&#10;            spinner.tick();&#10;            std::thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(50));&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    spinner.finish_with_message(&quot;✓ 全部完成&quot;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    spinner_demo();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use indicatif::{ProgressBar, ProgressStyle};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::time::Duration;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn spinner_demo() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let spinner = ProgressBar::new_spinner();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    spinner.set_style(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ProgressStyle::default_spinner()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .tick_strings(&#x26;[\"⠋\", \"⠙\", \"⠹\", \"⠸\", \"⠼\", \"⠴\", \"⠦\", \"⠧\", \"⠇\", \"⠏\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .template(\"{spinner:.green} {msg}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .unwrap(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let steps = vec![</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"正在解析依赖...\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"正在下载包...\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"正在编译项目...\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"正在运行测试...\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for step in steps {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        spinner.set_message(step.to_string());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for _ in 0..20 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            spinner.tick();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            std::thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(50));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    spinner.finish_with_message(\"✓ 全部完成\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    spinner_demo();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Spinner 样式</th>\n<th>字符集</th>\n<th>视觉效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>点阵</td>\n<td><code>⠋⠙⠹⠸⠼⠴⠦⠧⠇⠏</code></td>\n<td>经典 Braille 动画</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旋转线</td>\n<td><code>|/-\\</code></td>\n<td>简洁经典</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弹跳点</td>\n<td><code>⣾⣽⣻⢿⡿⣟⣯⣷</code></td>\n<td>丰富动感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月相</td>\n<td><code>🌑🌒🌓🌔🌕🌖🌗🌘</code></td>\n<td>可爱趣味</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"node-js-ora\">Node.js：ora</h2><p><strong>ora</strong> 是 Node.js 生态中最流行的 spinner 库，API 简洁优雅。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import ora from &#39;ora&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function buildProject(): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const spinner = ora(&#39;正在编译项目...&#39;).start();&#10;&#10;  try {&#10;    await new Promise((resolve) =&gt; setTimeout(resolve, 2000));&#10;    spinner.text = &#39;正在运行测试...&#39;;&#10;&#10;    await new Promise((resolve) =&gt; setTimeout(resolve, 1500));&#10;    spinner.text = &#39;正在生成产物...&#39;;&#10;&#10;    await new Promise((resolve) =&gt; setTimeout(resolve, 1000));&#10;    spinner.succeed(&#39;构建完成&#39;);&#10;  } catch (error) {&#10;    spinner.fail(&#39;构建失败&#39;);&#10;    throw error;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function multiStep(): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const steps = [&#10;    { text: &#39;安装依赖&#39;, duration: 2000 },&#10;    { text: &#39;编译源码&#39;, duration: 3000 },&#10;    { text: &#39;运行测试&#39;, duration: 1500 },&#10;    { text: &#39;打包产物&#39;, duration: 1000 },&#10;  ];&#10;&#10;  for (const step of steps) {&#10;    const spinner = ora(step.text).start();&#10;    await new Promise((resolve) =&gt; setTimeout(resolve, step.duration));&#10;    spinner.succeed();&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ora </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ora'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildProject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> spinner</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ora</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'正在编译项目...'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resolve, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    spinner.text </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '正在运行测试...'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resolve, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    spinner.text </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '正在生成产物...'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"lin