"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { text: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'打包产物'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> step</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> steps) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> spinner</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ora</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(step.text).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resolve, step.duration));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    spinner.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">succeed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"进度条与-stderr\">进度条与 stderr</h2><p>进度信息应输出到 <strong>stderr</strong> 而非 stdout，这样管道中的数据不会被进度条污染。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use indicatif::ProgressBar;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let pb = ProgressBar::new(100)&#10;        .with_style(&#10;            indicatif::ProgressStyle::default_bar()&#10;                .template(&quot;{bar:40} {pos}/{len}&quot;)&#10;                .unwrap(),&#10;        );&#10;&#10;    for i in 0..100 {&#10;        println!(&quot;data_line_{}&quot;, i);&#10;        pb.inc(1);&#10;        std::thread::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(20));&#10;    }&#10;    pb.finish_and_clear();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use indicatif::ProgressBar;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let pb = ProgressBar::new(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_style(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            indicatif::ProgressStyle::default_bar()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .template(\"{bar:40} {pos}/{len}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .unwrap(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..100 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"data_line_{}\", i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pb.inc(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        std::thread::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(20));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pb.finish_and_clear();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输出通道</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>stdout</td>\n<td>程序结果数据</td>\n<td>可被管道捕获</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>stderr</td>\n<td>进度条、spinner</td>\n<td>不影响管道数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> indicatif 默认将进度条渲染到 stderr，这是正确的行为。如果使用自定义进度输出，确保写入 stderr。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((进度与动画))&#10;    进度条&#10;      已知总量任务&#10;      百分比和 ETA&#10;      多任务并行&#10;    Spinner&#10;      未知时长任务&#10;      状态文本更新&#10;      多种动画样式&#10;    Rust 生态&#10;      indicatif&#10;      MultiProgress&#10;    Node.js 生态&#10;      ora&#10;      listr2&#10;    最佳实践&#10;      输出到 stderr&#10;      完成后清除或标记&#10;      非 TTY 降级\">mindmap\n  root((进度与动画))\n    进度条\n      已知总量任务\n      百分比和 ETA\n      多任务并行\n    Spinner\n      未知时长任务\n      状态文本更新\n      多种动画样式\n    Rust 生态\n      indicatif\n      MultiProgress\n    Node.js 生态\n      ora\n      listr2\n    最佳实践\n      输出到 stderr\n      完成后清除或标记\n      非 TTY 降级</pre><ul>\n<li>操作耗时超过 1 秒应提供进度反馈，已知总量用进度条，未知时长用 spinner</li>\n<li>indicatif 是 Rust 生态的进度显示标准库，支持单进度条、多进度条和 spinner</li>\n<li>ora 是 Node.js 生态中最简洁的 spinner 库，适合多步骤任务展示</li>\n<li>进度信息应输出到 stderr，确保不污染管道中的数据流</li>\n<li>任务完成后应显示成功/失败标记，或清除进度显示</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"进度与动画","id":"进度与动画"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要进度反馈","id":"为什么需要进度反馈"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust：indicatif","id":"rust-indicatif"},{"level":2,"text":"Spinner 动画","id":"spinner-动画"},{"level":2,"text":"Node.js：ora","id":"node-js-ora"},{"level":2,"text":"进度条与 stderr","id":"进度条与-stderr"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"交互式提示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/interactive-prompts"},"next":{"title":"颜色与格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/color-and-formatting"}}